    <h2>What you get on disk</h2>
    <p>Each conversation is stored as files you can open offline — typically Markdown for reading and JSON for structure. That’s the difference between “I have a zip somewhere” and “I can find that answer.”</p>
    <h2>Be a good citizen</h2>
    <p>Use your own account, respect Perplexity’s terms, and don’t hammer servers. TotalRecalls keeps conservative pacing for that reason.</p>

